title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: b_fundraising_timer <= 0
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/ruble.jpg
tags: b_party
on-arrival: {! 
Q.b_fundraising_timer = 4;
Q.week_actions += 1;
Q.b_dues_income = Math.round((Q.party_membership / 1000 * Q.b_dues) * (2 + (1 - (Q.instability / 100))));
Q.b_dues_income2 = Math.round((Q.party_membership / 1000 * (Q.b_dues - 1)) * (2 + (1 - (Q.instability / 100))));
Q.b_dues_income3 = Math.round((Q.party_membership / 1000 * (Q.b_dues + 1)) * (2 + (1 - (Q.instability / 100))));
!}

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ b_dues_income +] party funds gained.
on-arrival: resources += b_dues_income; 

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ b_dues_income2 +] party funds gained.
choose-if: b_dues > 1
unavailable-subtitle: We've already abolished dues. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_dues -= 1;
  Q.resources += Q.b_dues_income2;
  Q.b_dissent -= 0.1; Q.leninist_dissent -= 4; Q.moderate_dissent -= 4; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 4;
!}

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: [+ b_dues_income3 +] party funds gained. [? if hunger >= 15 : <br>Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if b_dues >= 4 : <br>Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_dues += 1; Q.resources += Q.b_dues_income3;
  Q.workers_b -= 3; Q.underclass_b -= 3;
  if (Q.hunger >= 25) {
    Q.workers_b -= 7; 
    Q.underclass_b -= 10;
  }
  if (Q.b_dues >= 5) {
    Q.workers_b -= 3*Q.b_dues;
    Q.underclass_b -= 3*Q.b_dues;
  }
  Q.leninist_dissent += 4; Q.moderate_dissent += 4; Q.leftcom_dissent += 4; Q.b_dissent += 0.1;
!}

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources.

[? if hunger >= 15: Given the present levels of poverty and hunger, raising dues may be a bad idea. ?]
